WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:12.440
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.410
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.620
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.420
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.860
Ah, I-I'm sorry, Henriette-san!

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:24.250
We must be bothering you by lingering behind even though we're already expelled!

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.480
We'll leave right now!

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.580
Sherlock...

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.800
Please wait!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:01.540
L-Let's at least say our final farewells at this academy...

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:06.650
What? You mean facing the school building and saying "Thank you very much"?

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:07.490
Yes!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.670
We were chased out, you know.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:14.180
We couldn't become detectives. Milky Holmes is over!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.880
Good-bye, Sher.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.020
Good-bye, everyone...

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.120
Thank you very much!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.780
So they finally left.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.130
We've won beautifully, my little kitties!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.990
Now's the time to take it all off and celebrate!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.240
Arsène-sama must be overjoyed.

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:06.960
<i>Everything's come to this because I wasn't serious enough...</i>

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:10.390
<i>In that case, this will be the last time...</i>

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:14.590
<i>The last time that I will put my all into cornering you!</i>

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.660
Welcome!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.730
Where's my garlic noodles?

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.370
Coming right up!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.100
What about my noodle soup?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.490
That one's not ready yet.

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.220
At least say "Coming right up," jeez!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.390
I'm sorry, sir! I tripped on the floor!

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:41.770
Ah, right away!

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:43.230
You're leaving me like this?!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.980
Excuse me!

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:46.050
No excuses!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.160
I'm sorry!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.720
Where's my noodle soup?!

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.890
It's not ready yet.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.760
Here's the next report.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:58.310
Yokohama police have announced that the Phantom Thief Empire, led by Arsène, has engaged in 26 accounts of theft over this past fortnight.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.270
Fried pork, now.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.850
Ah, Saku-san!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.810
So the rumours on the net were true after all.

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.540
They said that Sherlock was working in a restaurant in the slums.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.820
Though these may be slums, working here keeps food on my table!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.160
I'll give this to you. I already got a new model anyways.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.860
Sherlock!

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:15.770
There you are!

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:16.650
Tsugiko-san!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.310
I heard it was a restaurant in the slums,

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:21.250
but what is this place?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.550
A noodle house in these slums!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.370
Evil spirits, disperse!

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:28.610
There are many evil spirits in these slums! Must disperse!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.100
Hirano-san...

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.690
Thank you so much!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.060
Sherlock!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.310
Stupid!!

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.870
Even though you've fallen as a gypsy in these slums,

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.570
don't you dare die on me!!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:45.030
Though these may be the slums, I'm not a gypsy and I didn't say I was dying!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.360
Eh? Really?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:53.240
Though many detectives are currently in pursuit of the Phantom Thief Empire, the situation is still grave.

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.620
Eh? Arsène and the others have?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.410
Yeah. They've been rampaging nightly for the past two weeks.

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.600
You didn't know?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.500
I've been working non-stop, so...

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.300
At first they were continuing with the usual gems and paintings,

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.410
but they moved onto bigger and bigger stuff.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:10.240
They finally stole an entire skyscraper last night.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.970
Furthermore, the number of other phantom thieves has gone up, too.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:20.240
It seems that everyone at Holmes Detective Academy is busy chasing them down.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.880
Everyone is...

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.110
Arsène is on the move again!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.400
Time to dispatch!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.980
Arsène! You will never get away!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.890
Amateurs are to stay put!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.420
Ow...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.010
Would you like a flower...

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.220
I have as many as you'd like...

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.690
Pretty flowers...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.260
I have as many as you'd like!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.190
Here, mister!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:07:00.080
The answer is "Yes!" So you must be hungry right now, eh?

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.260
Eh? Uh...

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:05.210
And then "G!" You're thinking of "Going to eat a beef bowl!"

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.020
No, a seaweed lunch set...

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.320
Do you put red pickled ginger on your beef bowls? Or what?

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:14.570
Cordelia-san! Nero! So you were here, huh?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.290
Please buy my magazines...

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.450
Thanks, Sher! It's been so long since I've had meat buns!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.970
So you're working at a noodle house, huh?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.820
Yes! It's quite fun. It might just be my thing!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:42.260
I tried working at a hamburger joint, but...

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.440
It didn't work out so well...

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.570
No! I hate being in the dark! It's cramped―

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:52.700
I tried a family restaurant, but...

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.690
Jeez, just spit out your orders already!

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:59.390
I've been waiting here forever! Damn old hags!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.390
Maybe a step up from that is better if I'm gonna work again...

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.470
So everyone is set on their dreams, eh?

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:06.830
Herc-san, what about you?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:10.910
I was handing out tissues...

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.770
But I don't ever wanna do it again...

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.980
Yokohama Detective Metropolis sure has changed, huh...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:28.160
Maybe it should be named Yokohama Phantom Thief Metropolis now that there's so many of them...

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.400
Citizens of Yokohama, good evening.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.010
Arsène!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.440
Let me show you something entertaining.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.250
Henriette-san?!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:57.540
This is Holmes Detective Academy's student council president, Henriette Mystère.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:01.600
Once we crush the academy, our work shall be finished.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:07.820
In other words, the change of Yokohama into a heaven for phantom thieves, not detectives.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:11.030
That's... Yokohama Forest's...

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.070
Grand Yokohama Canyon!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:21.360
I shall cut the ropes hanging her one by one throughout the next two hours.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:26.710
If there are still fools who believe in justice in this city, then come to her rescue.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.390
I will crush each and every one of you,

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.710
and then turn Yokohama into a heaven for phantom thieves!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
Oh my god...

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.070
She's so cruel...

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.470
Is Yokohama done for?

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.440
W-What'll we do? Henriette-san will...!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:41.790
Arsène! Unforgivable!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.590
This is so mean...

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.670
Let's go!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:49.640
You might say that, but we're just normal girls now!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.250
What are you saying we can do?

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.740
G4 will probably pull through for us.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.750
We're... already...

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.990
You're... right...

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.620
And cut!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.250
*step*

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.840
No one else but I is fit to be disguised as the beautiful Arsène-sama!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.670
I love you, Twenty!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.630
Even so, I'm still confused...

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:25.540
Though this may be Arsène-sama we're talking about, if by some chance she were to fall down there...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:30.000
It shows just how much she's determined to crush those losers of justice!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.650
Yeah. She must be testing our powers as well by dressing herself as the bait.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.270
This is...

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.080
My all...

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.790
Hold on tight!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.980
In that case...

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.090
Phantom Thief Empire! You're under arrest!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.850
We shall dispose of you weaklings in a beautiful manner.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:07.600
How many more people to go until our revolution?

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.980
Hurry... Come get me...

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.400
Milky Holmes...

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.310
Where's my noodles?

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.530
Yes, right away...

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.590
You forgot to simmer it!

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:25.450
Yes, I'll bring a new one right away...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.290
G4 will protect Yokohama!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.620
Prepare to die with honor!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:34.000
Grand Yokohama Canyon, now.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.750
Here I come!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:56.110
Hey! Let me go! If you don't, my higher-ups are gonna kick your ass!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.110
Turn into a doll.

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.670
And so...

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:07.170
Your petty police were nothing more than flies to swat.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:10.460
Ahh, I've whipped them up good in this miserable festival!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.810
G4's Akechi Kokoro is now in this state.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:17.840
Now, get ready to party for the dawn of a new age in Yokohama, my dearies!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:18.460
*kiss*

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:22.960
What are the police doing? They can't even save just one person?!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.930
Useless police! Dammit, dammit, dammit!

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.540
Henriette-san!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:38.480
To the followers of justice in this city, you have two hours to save Henriette Mystère from her doom.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.390
They say two hours...

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:44.030
The wind tonight is fierce, so she might not even last that long.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:13:01.630
As powerful and ephemeral as moonlight...

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:05.510
Her name is Henriette Mystère.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:11.140
O great moon... dispel the darkness once again with thine light...

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:14.280
Hey, tell me! Will Henriette-san be saved?

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:15.890
Tell me!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:20.470
Saved... not saved... saved...

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.320
Sher...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.410
Cordelia-san!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.870
Herc-san!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.110
Nero!

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.170
W-What is it?!

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.600
Let's go and save Henriette-san!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.570
Huh?

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.650
We don't have our Toys...

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:45.050
We already talked about this! We're no longer students of Holmes Detective Academy! It's impossible!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.280
We're useless...

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:50.720
Also, why do we have to save the very one who expelled us in the first place?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:53.060
Idiot! Nero, you liar!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.100
We fell together as a group, so we'll rise again as one!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:14:00.680
You all said that you were aiming to become detectives, to become better, to become like what we used to be!!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:04.520
What're you saying? We didn't become detectives, did we?!

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.440
Nothing came out of aiming for anything!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:11.740
That's because we gave up halfway! We gave up on ourselves!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:18.210
So what if we're expelled? We can still accomplish good deeds, even if we're not true detectives―like Mary-san and Kate-san!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:28.800
Besides, your priorities are messed up if you think that becoming detectives comes first before saving people dear to us!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:37.680
I don't want that! I... I don't want my beloved friends to ruin themselves like this!

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:40.850
Sher...

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.520
I was wrong to snap at you.

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:49.560
We've lost sight of what's truly important to us, as fellow human beings...

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:52.370
It's really... embarrassing...

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:57.090
Sher, I'd forgotten at some point...

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.050
What you feel right now...

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.310
Cordelia-san...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.590
I'll try and believe in myself once more.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.310
We have to save Henriette-san...

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:17.220
Kamaboko!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.370
You've come back!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.770
Milky Holmes plus Kamaboko, dispatch!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:32.520
Get it together! We haven't even lasted ten minutes!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:35.800
It's no use... I'm only good at sleeping now...

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:39.760
Me too, I'm good at eating, but running is kinda...

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.380
You're going to Grand Yokohama Canyon, right?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.950
Irene-chan!

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.590
Get in. I'll take you there.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.840
Irene Doala...

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:57.280
She's the girl that Sher and Kokoro saved in Yokohama Forest, right?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.970
Actually, it was me who saved them.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.210
This is an amazing car!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.810
The trunk is also spacious.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.100
Yes?

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.690
A delivery for you ~oink.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:10.910
Good work!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.570
Ah, it's from Sonia-chan.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:18.240
"Here is a ring that is infused with a single dose of my Toys's power.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.890
Sherlock-senpai, who is of the same bloodline as I, should be able to use it.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.750
Sincerely, Sonia."

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.420
Ah, thank you, Sonia-chan!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.670
This should be quite helpful!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.170
One more thing ~oink.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.090
This is from Princess Claris.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.880
She says that there were too many souvenirs left over from the wedding ceremony.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.850
Don't need this one...

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:48.770
No one's coming! Does Yokohama even have any guts left?

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:53.370
A lot of detectives came too, but to think that was all Yokohama could offer!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.570
Well, guess it can't be helped if the police are like that.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.010
Half an hour more, huh.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:05.570
Hey, since no one's coming, let's help Arsène down! The farce is over, anyways!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:09.910
No can do. She says that the Phantom Thief Empire will disband if she's brought down before the time limit.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:14.720
I'm gonna tell Arsène-sama that no one else is coming!

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.220
It's fine.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:23.210
<i>Something</i> else is coming. 1, 2, 3...

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:26.730
Oh, guess they're not comin'.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.490
Phantom Thief Empire!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.440
Change one.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:44.370
Please give us back Henriette-san!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.410
What if it was a flush?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.340
Are you listening?

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:51.380
Raise. No way you've got a flush. Even though you're a pig at this―

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.260
Is this how you do things, Rabbit-san?!

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.630
I told you it's Rat!!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:18:01.320
I've misjudged you! I thought that the one thing you wouldn't do was take hostages!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:02.890
Cowards!

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:05.390
What's so beautiful about you, ugly Twenty?!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:07.770
Damn you!

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:11.240
What are you doing?!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.800
Get off me!!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:13.780
Go, Sher!!

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.280
Henriette-san!

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.350
Hold it!

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.200
She'll reach Arsène-sama!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.900
We can't let her fall!

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:29.080
This is... the only thing we can do...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.710
Sher... please...

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.570
Let go of me, you brat!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:43.050
Like I'd let you get away! Sher!!

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.310
Henriette-san!!

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:49.890
Sherlock...

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:52.190
I'm on my way!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.680
Corner... more...

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.860
Corner Milky Holmes!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:01.770
She called me ugly! She said ugly! She said ugly! Ugly!!

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:02.570
Twenty, watch it!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.950
No!!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:09.000
Coward, coward, coward!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.710
Dammit! Even if you do this, you can't win without your Toys!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.970
Shut up, retard!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.420
If I lose here now, Sher will...!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:22.340
We must... save... Henriette-san...

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.720
That's our...

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:28.890
That's Milky Holmes's... victory!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.810
Henriette-san, please hold on! I'm...

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.490
Blunt edge strike.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:45.990
Henriette-san!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.240
Arsène-sama!!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.130
Sherlock!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.960
Henriette-san!!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:15.500
No!!!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.730
This is...

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:28.080
Henriette-san...

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.110
That's...

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.710
That's Sher's...

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.920
<i>I understand... It's come back...</i>

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.470
It's returned to everyone!

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.660
I can feel it.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.370
Arsène-sama!!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:58.220
Here comes your faithful and too-beautiful doorbell banger!

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.820
Don't make light of Milky Holmes!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:07.490
The ever-radiant, ever-showy, ever-beautiful...

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.120
Twenty!!

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.940
Henriette-san, I'm so glad I saved you! My Toys has―

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.170
Ow...

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.100
Henriette-san?!

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.300
So my bet paid off...

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.450
A-Arsène!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.850
What did you do with Henriette-san?!

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.710
At last, I finally get to fight the real you...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:41.180
No, the you that has powered up more than usual with the strength of a raging fire...

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.360
I can finally defeat you...

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:23.050
Our Toys are back! Milky Holmes has synchronized into one!

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:24.450
Our Toys are finally back!
Everything's fine now that our Toys are back!

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:25.740
Time to synchronize and solve cases again!

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.800
Let's show everyone our power!

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:27.620
Yes, our flowerbed is back!!

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:29.920
We'll defeat Arsène and protect Yokohama!

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:30.080
If we do this, even our teachers will be grateful!

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:31.550
And I'm going to be the one to protect our flowers!

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:32.520
Let's all do this together for everyone's sake, including ours!

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:35.490
No one else believed us, but we've bloomed again magnificently!

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:36.350
Milky Holmes will be together forever!

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:38.640
We're detectives! We capture phantom thieves! And we use Baritsu!

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.660
Next time: The Return of Milky Holmes!

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:42.660
The culprit is Milky Holmes~!!

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:44.690
The culprit is Milky Holmes!

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:47.820
We couldn't get in sync at all...
